# Naming

| Kind | Style | Example |
|------|--------|---------|
| Component folders / files | PascalCase | `UserProfile.tsx`, `CardTasks/` |
| Hooks | `use` + PascalCase | `usePlatformAuth.ts` |
| Utils | camelCase | `loadImage.ts` |
| Variables / functions | camelCase | `fetchTasksList` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `API_BASE` |

## File layout

Same folder triple for **UI**, **Feature**, and **pages**:

```
Name/
  Name.tsx
  Name.module.scss   # optional (omit if no styles)
  index.ts
  components/        # nested blocks only — Child/Child.tsx + module + index.ts
  utils/
  hooks/
```

- Nested Feature/UI (incl. Figma sections): `Name/components/<Child>/`, not flat `Name/Child.tsx`.

- Pages: `src/pages/Name/` — not flat `src/pages/Name.tsx`.
- Put shared utils in `src/utils/` (`@utils/*`).
- Put domain API modules in `src/api/<domain>.ts`.
- Prefer named exports for components.
- Prefer path aliases over deep relative imports (`../../../`).
